<title>UK: Medeva wants transfer ADR listing to NYSE.</title>
<headline>Medeva wants transfer ADR listing to NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drugs group Medeva Plc said it made an application to transfer the listing of its American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) to the New York Stock Exchange from the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The move reflects Medeva's growing presence in the U.S., the pharmaceutical group said.</p>
</text>
